  "question": {
    "text": "For real gases, the relation between P, V and T is given by van der Waals equation, <math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">P</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mo>-</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">b</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mo>.</mo></math> For the following gases <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub><mo>,</mo><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> which gas will have <br/>(i) highest value of 'a' and (ii) lowest value of 'b' respectively?",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "2U3Wn",
      "text": "(i) <math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">O</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math> , (ii) <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msub></math>",
